    "alltext": "19. MAN Epudaina appudu appudu Baba CHINTHAN BABA Epudaina appudu appudu...appudu appudu MAN (ashamed) Avunu Baba CHINTHAN BABA Ee Nikrushtamaina ee parikramam ippude maaneyaali...oka pancheyyi...ashram store ke velli nalabai “dhumapaanam arikatte pattilu“ konukko..leda yenabai teesukunte 20% discount... The devotees start cheering and chanting his name. Meanwhile, the FOREST MINISTER arrives. People start saluting him, as he heads right to CHINTHAN BABA. Over the pool, he greets him, bends over and touches CHINTHAN BABA’s feet. CHINTHAN BABA Dheergayushmanbhava FOREST MINISTER Lopalaki raa maataddaali The two of them walk along the platform connecting the pool to dry land. CHINTHAN BABA spots SULOCHANA in the crowd. CHINTHAN BABA (to SULOCHANA) Nee kavalsina valla ki tvaralo problem vosthundi...vachinappudu naa daggariki raa FOREST MINISTER Arey nuvvu rammante vaachestudha adhi CHINTHAN BABA Prati manishiki problem raavatam sahajame...ippudu kerchief veysedam valla ae problem vachina naa daggariki vastundi He looks at his disciples. The masses are frenzied again. CHINTHAN BABA leaves to a rockstar exit. CUT TO:",
